norm=lambda s:s.lower().replace('’',"'").replace('herod antipas','herod')
acting={'quote-02':'Measured statement; restrained authority, no compulsory yelling.','quote-03':'Clear teaching instructions, limited head/brow movement; intercut attentive listeners over the same uninterrupted speech.','quote-07':'Uneasy recognition, mature authority; no stock-villain performance.','quote-08':'Firm rebuke, without added words; exact approved Baptist take.','quote-09':'Ceremonious offer addressing the daughter; exact approved Herod take.','quote-10':'Public oath with authority; avoid forcing exaggerated yelling.','quote-11':'Brief practical question to her mother; no sexualized performance.','quote-12':'Brief deliberate answer; exact approved Herodias take, no added laugh or words.','quote-13':'Prompt direct request; exact approved daughter take, no invented dialogue.','quote-14':'Warm invitation to rest; seek quieter delivery within tested LTX limits.','quote-16':'Brief direct instruction; restrained face and clear articulation.','quote-18':'Practical conversational question; avoid overplaying emphasis.','quote-21':'Firm reassurance that calms fear; not anger or a shouted performance.'}
